  "_coverage_note": "This file covers 12 of Ghana's 16 regions with real, named, sourced schools. Western North, Oti, Savannah and North East regions have NO entries yet - not because such schools don't exist, but because a citable, named category-list source for them wasn't found and located in the time available for this pass. Do not treat a region's absence here as 'no schools there' - treat it as 'not yet sourced', and add it the same way the other regions were added (see docs/extending-data.md). Category letters (A/B/C) are GES's school-resourcing tier, not a measure of exam performance, and several of the Category-C entries here have the generic '/Tech' or '/Community' name exactly as published in the source list because no fuller official name was found; treat those as lower-confidence on the precise spelling. No programme offerings, no aggregate cutoffs, and no school-specific admission data are included for any school below - per docs/extending-data.md, that is real sourcing work still to be done, not something to guess at here.",
